<title>NETHERLANDS: Shares in Wolters Kluwer jump.</title>
<headline>Shares in Wolters Kluwer jump.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in publisher Wolters Kluwer rose 4.00 guilders to 231.80 on Monday after the firm said it was not planning to split its shares in the short term.</p>
<p>Wolters said that it did not rule out such a move in the longer term.</p>
<p>Shares in Wolters Kluwer were up only 0.50 guilders before the statement.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
